{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02271",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 6.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.67,
      "end_seconds": 11.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.7,
      "end_seconds": 26.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.17,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come. It's a lump in my left breast, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.66,
      "end_seconds": 36.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.57,
      "end_seconds": 45.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.41,
      "end_seconds": 49.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.81,
      "end_seconds": 59.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "For the migraine prevention, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.48,
      "end_seconds": 63.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.66,
      "end_seconds": 68.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I've had it since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.17,
      "end_seconds": 72.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.52,
      "end_seconds": 78.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I mean, it usually comes with slight tenderness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.12,
      "end_seconds": 86.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 86.91,
      "end_seconds": 92.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.76,
      "end_seconds": 101.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "I was getting to that! The slight tenderness? That's been for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.01,
      "end_seconds": 110.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "So, have you had a lump in your left breast before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.29,
      "end_seconds": 118.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.71,
      "end_seconds": 125.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "Did you get weight loss, nipple discharge, lump under the arm or skin dimpling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.9,
      "end_seconds": 145.13,
      "duration_seconds": 18.23,
      "text": "No, no weight loss, no nipple discharge, no lump under the arm. I did have the lump being there for a month at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.83,
      "end_seconds": 150.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.42,
      "end_seconds": 153.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.29,
      "end_seconds": 158.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.73,
      "end_seconds": 163.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "So, my mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.21,
      "end_seconds": 168.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.21,
      "end_seconds": 178.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "I've got anxiety. Asthma, for five years. I've had migraines, yes. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.84,
      "end_seconds": 189.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.96,
      "text": "Understood. Right, so anxiety and asthma are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.76,
      "end_seconds": 196.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.87,
      "end_seconds": 214.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.36,
      "end_seconds": 225.88,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.62,
      "end_seconds": 229.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "So, anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.63,
      "end_seconds": 234.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Just my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.44,
      "end_seconds": 255.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.13,
      "end_seconds": 267.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.93,
      "end_seconds": 296.17,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, BP is 126 over 72. And heart rate 79, temperature is 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.86,
      "end_seconds": 303.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.4,
      "end_seconds": 305.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.23,
      "end_seconds": 324.34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "There is a firm, mobile, round lump about two centimetres in the upper outer part and no lumps under the arm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.5,
      "end_seconds": 346.02,
      "duration_seconds": 17.52,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably a breast lump needing triple assessment. I'd also keep a cyst in mind. A benign fibroadenoma is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.98,
      "end_seconds": 350.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.39,
      "end_seconds": 372.18,
      "duration_seconds": 15.79,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a breast lump needing triple assessment, but I'd like to confirm. I'm going to order a mammogram and ultrasound, for breast lump."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 376.49,
      "end_seconds": 381.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "We have a slot Wednesday at 3:30 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.26,
      "end_seconds": 388.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "I think a needle biopsy makes sense here, for breast lump."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.74,
      "end_seconds": 389.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.21,
      "end_seconds": 406.05,
      "duration_seconds": 14.84,
      "text": "This does not mean cancer, but we do arrange a specialist one-stop clinic to be sure. I'd like you back after the clinic. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.2,
      "end_seconds": 412.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.58,
      "end_seconds": 416.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Alright, all the best."
    }
  ]
}